<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" updated="November 2026" description="How Inge Performance Lab collects, uses and protects information shared through this website." intro="This policy explains what information Inge Performance Lab (IPL) collects through this website, how we use it, and the choices you have.">
  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We collect information you choose to give us, such as your name, email address, phone number and the details you include when you fill out a contact form, a donation request or a tour request.</p>
  <p>Like most websites, we also collect basic usage data automatically, such as pages visited, browser type and approximate location, to understand how the site is used and improve it.</p>
  <h2>Bookings and payments</h2>
  <p>Lessons, rentals, memberships and programs are booked through Swift, our booking provider. When you book or pay, your information is handled by Swift under its own privacy policy. IPL does not store payment card details on this website.</p>
  <h2>How we use your information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your questions and requests.</li>
    <li>To review donation and sponsorship requests.</li>
    <li>To send news and updates, if you opt in. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
    <li>To operate, secure and improve this website.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share it only with service providers who help us run the website and our business, such as hosting, email and booking providers, and only as needed to provide those services, or when required by law.</p>
  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Many of our athletes are minors. Forms on this website are intended to be completed by a parent, guardian or adult representative. If you believe a child has submitted personal information to us, contact us and we will delete it.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask us to access, correct or delete the personal information you have shared with us by contacting us using the details below.</p>
